  "gaps_note": "Gaps come from Woodshed's own event log. not_running: from the service's stop event (or, after a crash, the last message or event recorded before the next start; the start of such a gap is approximate) to the next start event, and before the first start on record. listener_down: from a bind error to that listener's next start. listener_stopped: from a listener stop while the service kept running (a settings change) to its next start. Gaps shorter than 1 s are left out. A device that simply sent nothing is not a gap.",
